# Supabase Configuration
# Get these from your Supabase project dashboard: Settings → API

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here

# ============================================
# SETUP INSTRUCTIONS
# ============================================

# FOR LOCAL DEVELOPMENT:
# 1. Copy this file to .env.local
# 2. Replace the placeholder values with your actual Supabase credentials
# 3. Run: npm install
# 4. Run: npm run dev

# FOR VERCEL DEPLOYMENT:
# 1. Go to your Vercel project dashboard
# 2. Navigate to: Settings → Environment Variables
# 3. Add each variable above (without the VITE_ prefix for Vercel, but keep it for your values)
# 4. For "Expose to Branch Deployments", select all branches
# 5. Save and redeploy

# HOW TO GET SUPABASE CREDENTIALS:
# 1. Go to https://supabase.com/dashboard
# 2. Select your project
# 3. Click "Settings" in the left sidebar
# 4. Click "API" 
# 5. Copy the "Project URL" → use as VITE_SUPABASE_URL
# 6. Copy the "anon public" key → use as VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY
